            "description": "Create an empty session. `id` is optional; Hermes generates one when omitted. `session_id` is accepted as an alias for `id`.\n\nExample response:\n```json\n{\n  \"object\": \"hermes.session\",\n  \"session\": {\n    \"id\": \"sa-analysis-001\",\n    \"source\": \"eksad-portal\",\n    \"model\": \"system-analyst\",\n    \"title\": \"Requirement Analysis\"\n  }\n}\n```",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"sa-analysis-001\",\n  \"title\": \"Requirement Analysis\",\n  \"source\": \"eksad-portal\",\n  \"model\": \"system-analyst\",\n  \"system_prompt\": \"Focus on technical requirement analysis and EKSAD architecture standards.\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
