            "description": "Execute one synchronous agent turn with plain text.\n\nExample response shape:\n```json\n{\n  \"object\": \"hermes.session.chat.completion\",\n  \"session_id\": \"sa-analysis-001\",\n  \"message\": {\n    \"role\": \"assistant\",\n    \"content\": \"Hasil analisis...\"\n  },\n  \"usage\": {\n    \"input_tokens\": 0,\n    \"output_tokens\": 0,\n    \"total_tokens\": 0\n  },\n  \"runtime\": {\n    \"provider\": \"openai-codex\",\n    \"model\": \"gpt-5.6-sol\"\n  }\n}\n```",
            "body": {
